  "mechanics": {
    "adaptive": "the committed values are here; the two the runtime moves between calls \u2014 the consequence mix the sampling actuator raises and steps back, and the decay the immune controller borrows \u2014 are in world.adaptive_scoring, and controller.decay and consequence_mix above are what they were committed at",
