      "penalty_cap": 0.5,
      "recurrence": "v = distance outside the inclusive region / scale; if v > 0: lambda' = clip(lambda + eta*v - kappa*max(0, v_previous-v), 0, lambda_max); otherwise lambda' = max(0, lambda-decay)"
    },
    "measurement": "Select the latest n completed returns, settled forecasts or closed windows. per=null pools the factory; role/assembly partitions responders' or forecasters' own samples, filtering roles by answers_for unless all. The controller receives the equal mean of supported scopes; fewer than n samples is unmeasured. Closed-window ratios recompute their denominators.",
