      "liability": "yes votes forecast the predicted direction; no votes its negation. Brier = 1 - (vote - outcome)^2, measured at the declared window after activation against the pre-activation value. No activation or missing evidence is censored. Feedback returns to the voting assembly's durable identity. Retirements use the same eligibility, draw, majority and cadence; with no predicted effect in a retire proposal, their ballots are unscored and censored.",
